    "description": "The Navisphere load board app enables you to find, book, track, and upload documents for truckloads instantly, making life easier for carrier owners, dispatchers, and drivers.  \r\nWith Navisphere, it\u2019s simple for contract carriers to manage their businesses and for drivers to submit load updates. One-touch functionality means it\u2019s easy to manage business on the go; drivers submit stop and in-transit updates and upload paperwork\u2014no phone call or email required! \u2013 while carriers find available freight loads with map and list views on the free load board so quickly it\u2019s almost effortless. \r\nThis ltl freight load board app is available 24/7, enabling near-real-time visibility for all C.H. Robinson loads when on the road. The app automatically connects to our Navisphere technology platform, eliminating the time and cost to complete required stop and in-transit updates. Drivers can also scan and submit load paperwork in the app using their phone\u2019s cameras to get the payment process started right away. \r\nTop features of Navisphere from C.H. Robinson include: \r\n- Find available freight loads and view load details that make trip decisions easy \r\n- Set preferences and filters to search loads matching your equipment and business \r\n- See the details you want in the format you prefer with multiple views, including map and list \r\n- Book loads immediately from the app. Now available on regular loads coordinated with your carrier representative. \r\n- View load details on your phone as soon as they\u2019re booked\u2014no desktop required \r\n- Reduce surprises for carriers and drivers with up-to-the minute notifications \r\n- Eliminate check calls and gain visibility with automated status updates \r\n- Upload documents, including bills of lading (BOL) for faster processing to get paid quickly and have visibility into your payment status \r\n- Access more loads than anywhere else. We have thousands of loads available for